# Lets .html pages run PHP (needed so api/ip_guard.php can be required at the
# top of each page to enforce hospital-only access). Standard on XAMPP and
# most cPanel/shared hosting (mod_php); if Jimat Hosting uses a PHP-FPM
# handler that ignores this, ask their support how to map .html to PHP.
AddType application/x-httpd-php .html .htm
